+*   Standard Occupancy Grids (e.g., Instant-NGP) only support bounded scenes; scene contraction is required to extend them to unbounded scenes [S4, unofficial].
+*   Spherical contraction maps straight rays to curves, complicating ray-AABB intersection tests for empty space skipping [S6].
 
